short001,The Dual‑VM Trick,"What if one chain could run every EVM contract — but 10x faster? Dual-VM: EVM compatibility, SVM for parallelized speed. No rewrite — just speed. Testnet link in bio.",The Dual‑VM Trick,Fast breakdown on Dual‑VM advantages,"crypto,dualVM,EVM,SVM,solidity",youtube,x,tiktok,10
